{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:b69f3214deb34e00","name":"Bib Fortuna","source":{"id":"source:reference-b69f3214deb34e00","title":"Bib Fortuna","revision":16212,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:56:31Z","sha256":"0193e0c0a35e71809edaec09083cc0387703a3cc6fd2cdf1e4f494f0b54a86ee","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=16212","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Bib%20Fortuna&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-b69f3214deb34e00","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rebellion Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Hutt Kajidics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Hutt_Kajidics","referenceId":"reference:3f107406b356c3df"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Bib Fortuna is the scheming, ambitious, manipulative, and underhanded majordomo of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jabba the Hutt"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jabba_the_Hutt","referenceId":"reference:4f1583c9ec5e6852"},"; he runs the organization's day-to-day operations. Fortuna begins as a ryll smuggler on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ryloth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ryloth","referenceId":"reference:ad4130ff69b659fe"},", where he is arrested. After escaping to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Tatooine"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tatooine","referenceId":"reference:a1b911e88e4876e1"},", he and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bidlo Kwerve"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bidlo_Kwerve?action=edit&redlink=1"}," make spice runs for Jabba and later move to slave trafficking. Fortuna is instrumental in bringing the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rancor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rancor","referenceId":"reference:fb68a8b2803a85f7"}," to Jabba. He uses the occasion to eliminate Kwerve, his primary rival, and to become Jabba's majordomo. Fortuna attempts to seize control of the organization following Jabba's death, but is quickly taken by the mysterious ",{"tag":"a","children":["B'omarr Monks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/B%27omarr_Monks"},". The monks remove Fortuna's brain and place it within a ",{"tag":"a","children":["BT-16 Perimeter Security Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/BT-16_Perimeter_Security_Droid","referenceId":"reference:47739f07eea2fe6c"},", a process reserved for monks who have reached enlightenment.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Sometime after the Battle of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Endor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Endor"},", a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Twi'lek"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Twi%27lek","referenceId":"reference:b787e536e15f2960"}," named ",{"tag":"a","children":["Firith Olan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Firith_Olan?action=edit&redlink=1"}," comes to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Tatooine"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tatooine","referenceId":"reference:a1b911e88e4876e1"}," to try to take control of the Hutt's criminal empire. Olan is captured by Fortuna, who convinces the monks to place his brain in Olan's body.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Bib Fortuna Statistics (CL 5)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Twi'lek"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Twi%27lek","referenceId":"reference:b787e536e15f2960"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Noble"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Noble","referenceId":"reference:190d375ec3483f8f"}," 2/",{"tag":"a","children":["Scoundrel"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scoundrel","referenceId":"reference:316d580fd4c35ecc"}," 3\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny_Points"},":"]}," 1; ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wi